+# Ivy Bridge	6.06		4.67/+30%	4.60/+32%
+# Haswell	5.45		4.15/+31%	3.57/+53%
+# Skylake	5.18		4.06/+28%	3.54/+46%
+# Bulldozer	9.11		5.95/+53%
